veSolutions":false,"ignoreCaseSensitivity":false}],"staticText":{"text":"<p><b>Build your potential | Using more than one adjective<\/b><\/p><p>When we use more than one adjective before a noun, we write opinion adjectives before description adjectives.<\/p><p>opinion: <em>beautiful<\/em>, <em>delicious<\/em><\/p><p>description: <em>big<\/em>, <em>new<\/em><\/p><p><em>Villa Koliba is a beautiful wooden house.<\/em><\/p>","backgroundColor":"rgba(161,245,222,0.23)","isSet":true}}]}